{"unit_id":"tag:0GY1:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n为说明证明，需要引入一些群概形（group schemes）。固定素数（prime number）<MATH_0001>。令\n<MATH_0002>\n换言之，<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的单生成扩张（monogenic extension），由本原（primitive）<MATH_0005>次单位根（root of unity）<MATH_0006>生成（generated）。置\n<MATH_0007>\n计算（从略）表明，<MATH_0008>可被<MATH_0009>整除（divisible），它在<MATH_0010>中。在<MATH_0011>上的第一个群概形（group scheme）是\n<MATH_0012>\n其群（group）律（law）由余乘法（comultiplication）\n<MATH_0013>\n给出。作此选择，有\n<MATH_0014>\n因此确实有如所示的<MATH_0015>-代数映射（algebra map）。省略验证这确实定义群（group）律（law）的过程。在<MATH_0016>上的第二个群概形（group scheme）是\n<MATH_0017>\n其群（group）律（law）由余乘法（comultiplication）\n<MATH_0018>\n给出。与此前相同的验证表明，这定义了群（group）律（law）。接着，注意多项式（polynomial）\n<MATH_0019>\n在<MATH_0020>中，次数（degree）为<MATH_0021>，且关于<MATH_0022>首一（monic）。具体地，<MATH_0023>的系数（coefficicient），对<MATH_0024>而言，等于<MATH_0025>；由于<MATH_0026>整除（divides）<MATH_0027>，它在<MATH_0028>中，这是<MATH_0029>的元素（element）。得到环映射（ring map）\n<MATH_0030>\n读者容易验证，它与余乘法（comultiplications）相容（compatible）。因此得到群概形（group schemes）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0031>\n下面的引理特别表明，此态射（morphism）忠实平坦（faithfully flat）（事实上将看到，它有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）满射（surjective））。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"group schemes","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"prime number","target_term":"素数"},{"source_term":"monogenic extension","target_term":"单生成扩张"},{"source_term":"primitive","target_term":"本原"},{"source_term":"root of unity","target_term":"单位根"},{"source_term":"generated","target_term":"生成"},{"source_term":"divisible","target_term":"整除"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"law","target_term":"律"},{"source_term":"comultiplication","target_term":"余乘法"},{"source_term":"algebra map","target_term":"代数映射"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"law","target_term":"律"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"law","target_term":"律"},{"source_