{"unit_id":"tag:0GY1:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n接着计算<MATH_0001>的核（kernel）。由于<MATH_0002>的原点（origin）由<MATH_0003>给出，它在<MATH_0004>中，可见<MATH_0005>的核（kernel）由<MATH_0006>给出。现在注意，<MATH_0007>-值点（points）\n<MATH_0008>\n属于<MATH_0009>，由\n<MATH_0010>\n给出，显然都包含在<MATH_0011>中。此外，这些点在<MATH_0012>的<TEXTBFOPEN_0001>所有<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001>纤维（fibres）中两两不同。读者还可算得<MATH_0013>。因此得到群概形（group schemes）的闭浸入（closed immersion）\n<MATH_0014>\n它将<MATH_0015>送到<MATH_0016>。然而，按构造，<MATH_0017>有限（finite）平坦（flat）于<MATH_0018>之上，次数（degree）为<MATH_0019>。故断定，此映射（map）是同构（isomorphism）。综上，得到短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0020>\n由<MATH_0021>上的群概形（group schemes）组成。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"origin","target_term":"原点"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"group schemes","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"group schemes","target_term":"群概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"origin","target_term":"原点","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"group schemes","target_term":"群概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_t